# Purpose: Normalizes repository line endings across developer workstations and CI runners.
# Why it exists: Windows and Linux tooling both edit this monorepo, so Git must preserve predictable text file endings.
# Architecture fit: Supports reproducible builds, clean diffs, and cross-platform developer workflow standards.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.jar binary
